[readiness/ci] Add a portable CI baseline (reviewing)
Files: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.
Do: Add a small workflow for the settled Rust toolchain that runs formatting, strict Clippy, workspace tests, locked metadata, and the selected package check on pull requests and the default branch. Keep it independent of private paths, local caches, external services, and optional browser inspection.
Accept: A fresh public runner can execute the workflow from the repository alone; required commands are explicit; failures are visible; and workflow commands match the local release gate.
-> readiness/metadata
-> readiness/scope
